    "text": "<p>Given, total energy given to electron in third orbit,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math></p><p>Energy of third orbit of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>-atom, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math></p><p>lonisation energy of electron of third orbit, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>'</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math></p><p>Hence, final energy of electron when it comes out of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>-atom from third orbit</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math></p>",
